      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-316414",
      ":question/problem": "A dataset of $31$ different video lengths (in minutes) has a mean of $42$ and a median of $42$. A new dataset is created by adding $5$ to each length. Which of the following measures does **NOT** have the same value in both the original and new datasets?\n\n1. Mean\n2. Median\n3. Range\n4. Standard deviation"
